#!/usr/bin/env ssc
---
name: rozum-control-center
version: 0.1.0
description: rozum unified control center (UCC) — one std/ui app, web target (react). PoC.
backends: [int]
frontend: react
---
# rozum — control center

A first `std/ui` (Tk) slice of the unified control center, rendered to the **web** backend.
The same `.ssc` will compile to **TUI** once the `frontend/tui` backend lands.

## Setup
[signal, emit, serve](std/ui/primitives.ssc)
[lower](std/ui/lower.ssc)
[defaultTheme](std/ui/theme.ssc)
[vstack, hstack, divider, spacer](std/ui/layout.ssc)
[heading, text](std/ui/typography.ssc)
[badge](std/ui/display.ssc)
[card, cardWithHeader](std/ui/containers.ssc)
[tableCol, tableRow, table](std/ui/data.ssc)

## Models / gateway panel
```scalascript
val gatewayCard = cardWithHeader(heading(2, "Gateway / residency"))(
  vstack(gap = 6)(
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("shared gateway:"), badge("none running", "neutral")),
    text("host RAM budget:   27.0 GiB"),
    text("available now:     23.4 GiB"),
    text("committed:         0 B"),
    text("resident models:   none")
  )
)

val catalogTable = table(
  List(tableCol("Installed model", "model"), tableCol("Size", "size")),
  List(
    tableRow(text("GLM-4-32B-0414-4bit"), text("17.1 GiB")),
    tableRow(text("GLM-4-9B-0414-4bit"),  text("4.9 GiB")),
    tableRow(text("Qwen3-4B-4bit"),       text("2.1 GiB")),
    tableRow(text("Qwen3-0.6B-4bit"),     text("0.3 GiB"))
  )
)
val modelsCard = cardWithHeader(heading(2, "Installed catalog"))(catalogTable)
```

## Meetings panel
```scalascript
val meetingsCard = cardWithHeader(heading(2, "Meetings — room: rozum"))(
  vstack(gap = 6)(
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("sunny-civet"),  badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("nimble-raven"), badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("plucky-finch"), badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("plucky-fox"),   badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("Sergiy"),       badge("operator", "neutral"))
  )
)
```

## Compose + serve
```scalascript
val view = vstack(gap = 16)(
  heading(1, "rozum — control center"),
  text("one .ssc -> web (and TUI, once frontend/tui lands) -- data via the rozum control-API"),
  divider(),
  hstack(gap = 16)(gatewayCard, modelsCard),
  divider(),
  meetingsCard
)

serve(lower(view, defaultTheme), 8410)
```
